/**
@defgroup app Application
@brief GUIApplication, the frame, GUIContent and event handlers.

Derive from tachyon::GUIApplication and describe the UI in `OnGUI()`; every control
is one of its member functions. The class page groups them by family. The
@ref md_docs_2overview "Overview" explains the frame model, and
@ref md_docs_2controls "Controls" covers each control.

@defgroup controls Controls
@brief Every control by family, and the types they take and return.

Controls are member functions of tachyon::GUIApplication. Guide:
@ref md_docs_2controls "Controls".

@defgroup controls_windows Windows and layout
@ingroup controls
@brief Windows, horizontal and vertical groups, areas, scroll bars, caching, label and
button groups.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginWindow "BeginWindow",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::EndWindow "EndWindow",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::OpenWindow "OpenWindow",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::CloseWindow "CloseWindow",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginGhostWindow "BeginGhostWindow",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginHorizontal "BeginHorizontal",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginVertical "BeginVertical",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginHorizontalWrap "BeginHorizontalWrap",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginVerticalWrap "BeginVerticalWrap",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginArea "BeginArea",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::VerticalScrollbar "VerticalScrollbar",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::HorizontalScrollbar "HorizontalScrollbar",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginCached "BeginCached",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Invalidate "Invalidate",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginLabelGroup "BeginLabelGroup",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginButtonGroup "BeginButtonGroup",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginToggleGroup "BeginToggleGroup".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2windows-and-layout "Windows and layout".

@defgroup controls_text Text and images
@ingroup controls
@brief Text, labels, drag labels, selectable text and images.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication): @ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Text "Text",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Label "Label",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::DragLabel "DragLabel",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::SelectableText "SelectableText",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Image "Image".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2text-and-images "Text and images".

@defgroup controls_buttons Buttons and toggles
@ingroup controls
@brief Buttons, command buttons, toggles, switches and checkboxes.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication): @ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Button "Button",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::CommandButton "CommandButton",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Toggle "Toggle",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Switch "Switch",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Checkbox "Checkbox".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2buttons-and-toggles "Buttons and toggles".

@defgroup controls_fields Fields
@ingroup controls
@brief Text, search, autocomplete, numeric, vector and typed fields, dropdowns, lists and
dictionaries.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication): @ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Field "Field",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::SearchField "SearchField",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::AutocompleteField "AutocompleteField",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::TypedField "TypedField",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Dropdown "Dropdown",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginFieldBox "BeginFieldBox".
Numeric limits and formatting per type: tachyon::NumericFieldConfig.
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2fields "Fields".

@defgroup controls_sliders Sliders
@ingroup controls
@brief Sliders with and without a value field.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::SliderField "SliderField",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Slider "Slider".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2sliders "Sliders".

@defgroup controls_color Color and gradient fields
@ingroup controls
@brief Color and gradient fields with their picker popups.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::ColorField "ColorField",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::GradientField "GradientField".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2color-and-gradient "Color and gradient fields".

@defgroup controls_lists Lists and reorderable groups
@ingroup controls
@brief List views and drag-to-reorder groups.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginListView "BeginListView",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::ListItem "ListItem",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginReorderableGroup "BeginReorderableGroup",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginReorderableItem "BeginReorderableItem".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2lists "Lists and reorderable groups".

@defgroup controls_data Tables, trees and grids
@ingroup controls
@brief Columns, sorting, selection and data sources for tables, tree views and grid views.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginTable "BeginTable",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginRow "BeginRow",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Cell "Cell",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::TreeCell "TreeCell",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::VirtualTable "VirtualTable",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::VirtualTreeView "VirtualTreeView",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginGridView "BeginGridView",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::GridViewItem "GridViewItem",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::VirtualGridView "VirtualGridView".
Tree and grid views: @ref md_docs_2controls_2trees-and-grids "Tree and grid views".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2tables "Tables".

@defgroup controls_docking Tabs, docking and toolbars
@ingroup controls
@brief Tab bars, dock nodes, dock layouts, documents, toolbars and the toolbar dock.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginTabBar "BeginTabBar",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Tab "Tab",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginDockingContainer "BeginDockingContainer",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Documents "Documents",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginToolbar "BeginToolbar".
The toolbar dock: tachyon::RenderToolbarDock.
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2tabs-docking-toolbars "Tabs, docking and toolbars".

@defgroup controls_menus Menus, tooltips and dialogs
@ingroup controls
@brief Menus, context menus, the menu and title bar, tooltips, message dialogs and toasts.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginMenu "BeginMenu",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::MenuItem "MenuItem",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginMenuBar "BeginMenuBar",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginTitleBar "BeginTitleBar",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginContextMenu "BeginContextMenu",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::SetTooltip "SetTooltip",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginTooltip "BeginTooltip",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::MessageDialog "MessageDialog",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::ShowToast "ShowToast",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Banner "Banner".
Tooltips and dialogs:
@ref md_docs_2controls_2tooltips-and-dialogs "Tooltips and message dialogs".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2menus "Menus".

@defgroup controls_nodes Node view
@ingroup controls
@brief Nodes, pins and links for the node graph editor.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::RenderNodeView "RenderNodeView",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::NodeText "NodeText".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2node-view "Node view".

@defgroup controls_other Other controls
@ingroup controls
@brief Breadcrumb, status bar, command search and the settings panel.

Calls (members of tachyon::GUIApplication):
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::Breadcrumb "Breadcrumb",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::BeginStatusBar "BeginStatusBar",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::StatusText "StatusText",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::CommandSearch "CommandSearch",
@ref tachyon::GUIApplication::RenderSettingsPanel "RenderSettingsPanel".
Guide: @ref md_docs_2controls_2other-controls "Other controls".

@defgroup layout Layout
@brief Flexbox and grid layout, constraints and units.

Sizes are CSS px scaled by the UI scale; see
@ref md_docs_2overview_2values "Return values, content and units".

@defgroup styling Styling
@brief Themes, styles, colors and gradients.

See @ref md_docs_2css "CSS and theming" for the CSS the themes are written in.

@defgroup text Text
@brief Shaping, fonts, text atlases, numeric text and the clipboard.

@defgroup input Input
@brief Input state, handlers, commands, shortcuts and undo history.

@defgroup elements Elements and state
@brief IDs, element storage and the state kept between frames.

See @ref md_docs_2overview_2ids "IDs" for how IDs stay stable.

@defgroup graphics Graphics
@brief The graphics backend interface, renderer, images and custom drawing.

@defgroup graphics_vulkan Vulkan backend
@ingroup graphics
@brief The Vulkan graphics backend, and sharing a host's device and images.

See @ref md_docs_2integration_2vulkan-device "Using your own Vulkan device".

@defgroup windows Windows and platform
@brief Window backends (SDL, null, image), OS windows and window flags.

See @ref md_docs_2integration_2window-and-input "Your own window and input".

@defgroup diagnostics Diagnostics and memory
@brief Logging, the profiler and allocation hooks.

@defgroup utilities Utilities
@brief Base types, results, hashing, JSON and number parsing.
*/
